<p><b>Case background</b></p><ol>
<li><b>ATLANTIC LION</b> =E2=80=93 Sinokor sold the vessel to HMM. Class chan=
ged from BV to KR because HMM policy sets KR class. This was not a service is=
sue. After long efforts, we recently managed to keep BV class for the 2 BV ve=
ssels HMM is acquiring.</li>
<li><b>SAEHAN SELINA (C GAS)</b> =E2=80=93 Saehan Marine began with 3 BV vess=
els and was very satisfied with our service. It recommended BV to other chemi=
cal owners and helped introduce Sungho Shipping to us. Over time, its request=
s for survey fee adjustment could not be accommodated, and its fleet with BV =
is now down to 1 vessel, SAEHAN JASPER. Fee level has been a recurring topic =
in our relationship, and we see a risk that this vessel may also move. After =
the sale of SAEHAN SELINA, the new owner, SJ Tanker, moved class to KR on 19 =
Mar 2026 (Equasis attached). The vessel remains in service. Fees are not the =
only factor: Saehan Marine continues to keep BV class on SAEHAN JASPER.</li>
<li><b>HONGKONG ENERGY</b> =E2=80=93 Class was withdrawn because the vessel w=
as scrapped.</li></ol>
<p><b>Assessment</b></p><ul>
<li>Two of the three exits came after a change of ownership. A sale does not =
resolve the issue: the owner's cost concern passes to the buyer.</li>
<li>For small and mid-sized Korean owners, KR is the main competitor. Our fee=
s are well above KR's. If the gap stays, we expect more TOCA OUTs in this seg=
ment.</li>
<li>These owners may also order newbuildings. If we lose their in-service cla=
ss, we may lose these projects too. This loss is not shown in the TOCA OUT or=
 GT figures, but it could be much bigger.</li></ul>
<p><b>To be considered</b></p><ul>
<li>Review whether our survey fees for small and mid-sized Korean owners can =
avoid being far above KR's level, including the impact on NS profitability.</=
li>
<li>If fees cannot be kept moderately above KR's level for structural reasons=
, we may need to limit our exposure to this segment and focus on other segmen=
ts where our pricing is competitive.</li></ul>
<p>Kind regards,<br>Sang-Jin</p></body></html>

